  "description": "Roof extension with rear dormer with roof terrace to Studio Flat 3, 170a and Studio Flat 3, 168a Leytonstone High Road. 1st floor extension to ground floor Flat 4 and 1st floor Flat 1,170a Leytonstone High Road with internal reconfiguration\n\nProposed development comprises improvements to four existing lawful residential flats at 168, 170, and 170a High Road, Leytonstone. Works include the construction of rear dormers and roof terraces to two top-floor studio flats (Flat 3 at No. 168 and Flat 3 at No. 170); a first-floor rear extension to Flat 4 at 170a High Road (Ground Floor Rear) with associated internal reconfiguration; and a modest first-floor rear extension to Flat 1 at 170a High Road. No change of use is proposed. All flats remain within Class C3 use. The aim is to improve internal layouts, daylight, circulation, and access to private amenity space.",
